\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SUNFLASH_BROKENSCANNER</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSUNFLASH_BROKENSCANNER%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSUNFLASH_BROKENSCANNER%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watcher</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/South_Span_Checkpoint\" title=\"South Span Checkpoint\">South Span Checkpoint</a> will get affected by this condition after getting <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blinded\">Blinded</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/Flashblinder\" title=\"Flashblinder\">Flashblinder</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714224551\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 805/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8218/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2548/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 980747/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.872      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   36.872      1 -total\n 48.65%   17.939      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 18.69%    6.892      2 Template:Condition_